logs_*.txt
launch_*.log
results/*.png
# The result artefacts are tracked despite the root *.jld2 rule. They total
# under half a megabyte and each one is hours of constrained solves -- the
# converged edges, the profiles, the stored winning models, the sensitivity
# depth. The root rule exists for data/ and outputs/, which are large and are
# rebuilt by the pipeline. These are not rebuildable in any useful sense.
!results/*.jld2
results/*smoke*.jld2
